OL,3,GNEWSAMan killed by falling tree as
OL,4,AStorm Boelo batters Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 60-year-old man has died after being
OL,7,Fstruck by a falling tree as Storm Boelo
OL,8,Fbrought strong winds and heavy rain to
OL,9,FScotland.
OL,11,FPolice said the man was on a minor road
OL,12,Fat Mid Kelton, near Castle Douglas, in
OL,13,FDumfries and Galloway.
OL,15,FEmergency services were alerted at
OL,16,Fabout 10:30 and the man was pronounced
OL,17,Fdead at the scene.
OL,19,FThe storm has left more than 50,000
OL,20,Fproperties without power, with winds
OL,21,Fgusting to 85mph at Machrihanish in
OL,22,FArgyll and Bute.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
